README

This directory is for student projects with Core Library.

Please work in your own directories only.

Make sure that every directory has a "Makefile" with these targets:

	> make		-- the default target will compile the programs
	> make test	-- to test your programs
	> make help	-- give some help on running your programs

Include a README file in your directory giving details about your project
	and conclusion.  Give your name and contact information there.

Feel free to explore other projects and other sample programs
	under progs (if you find any program not compiling,
